# 25. Backend vs Server

For this product, I would actually avoid calling it a traditional **backend**.

The more accurate architecture is:

> **Local Security Backend**

Because the security-critical backend runs entirely on the user's device.

```text
             Anoneurx Authenticator
                     │
        ┌────────────┴────────────┐
        │                         │
     Frontend                Local Backend
        │                         │
        │                 ┌───────┴────────┐
        │                 │                │
        │              Vault            Crypto
        │                 │                │
        │                 └───────┬────────┘
        │                         │
        └─────────────────────────┤
                                  │
                           Local Encrypted
                              Storage
```

**No remote backend is required.**

